{"chroma:document":"Top-K\nN/A\nTop-P\n1\nPrompt\nWrite a code snippet in Bash, which asks for a folder name.\nThen it takes the contents of the folder and renames all the\nfiles inside by prepending the name draft to the file name.","strategy":"B","year":2025,"section":"Code Prompting","page":43,"source":"data/raw/Prompt Engineering.pdf","chunk_index":1,"document_id":"google-prompt-engineering-20